---
title: "syncLegionAddresses (All Sale/Distribution Contracts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_guard: onlyLegion
    q_guard --> q_getRegistry: registry = LegionAddressRegistry
    q_getRegistry --> q_getBouncer: legionBouncer = registry.getLegionAddress(BOUNCER_ID)
    q_getBouncer --> q_getSigner: legionSigner = registry.getLegionAddress(SIGNER_ID)
    q_getSigner --> q_getFeeReceiver: legionFeeReceiver = registry.getLegionAddress(FEE_RECEIVER_ID)
    q_getFeeReceiver --> q_updateConfig: update s_config with new addresses
    q_updateConfig --> q_emit: emit LegionAddressesSynced(bouncer, signer, feeReceiver, ...)
    q_emit --> [*]: return

    note right of q_getRegistry
        INV-001: All address lookups from centralized LegionAddressRegistry
        INV-002: Sync must be explicitly called after registry update
    end note

    note right of q_updateConfig
        INV-003: Changes to signer affect signature validation for invest/claim
        INV-004: Changes to feeReceiver affect where fees are sent on withdrawal
    end note
